WEBVTT

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.990
If one were to come back to life, then the remaining two would definitely also revive.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.400
Kuro...

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.280
was...

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.160
the one who cast the curse of the Doppeliner system onto us humans?

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.490
This feeling is...

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.620
Now is the time for me to sever that fate.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.010
Masagami!

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:38.600
It seems the Masagami has yet to awaken within you.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:39.180
"Unearthly
Transformation"

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.510
Kuro...

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.600
Are you really...

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.600
I've felt it.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.650
I am... one of  the three Masagami.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:53.030
My brother started all of this in an attempt to save me.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.360
By sacrificing our mother, he released the Earth Seal.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.780
He destroyed all of the Reiseki.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.120
He re-awakened the Masagami.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.620
And he is now trying to defeat him.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.590
It was all so I would not have to die.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:38.320
As I expected. Attacks of such a level barely leave a scratch.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.120
They are human

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:41.910
and Mototsumitama.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.160
Nay.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:46.410
Both humans and Mototsumitama should have perished.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:47.580
Nay.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.420
Then they shall again perish.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:50.920
Then they shall again

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:51.920
perish.

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.180
Move!

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.690
What is it this time?

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.480
Riona-san!

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.610
The Masagami must have finally revived!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.240
Punipuni, I'm sorry.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.920
Take care of Punipuni.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.710
Kuro... You...

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.220
I'm going to go finish this.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.100
Now, but...

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.220
Nay.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:46.560
Human and Mototsumitama are

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.180
not melting...

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.390
Not melting.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.560
Then we shall

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.110
shatter them.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.250
Wait, Kuro!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.880
Are you going to forgive Reishin now?

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:18.380
You should know full well what he has done up until now.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.260
My brother committed those sins for my sake.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.180
That's why...

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.630
You shall shatter.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.390
They do not shatter.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.560
Nay.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.650
Brother!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.650
Reishin!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.440
Why did you come?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.200
They are... Masagami?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.620
They really do look just like Kuro.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.660
Don't come any closer!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.790
Hear me, Masagami.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.800
You, the enemy of man and Mototsumitama alike,

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.550
shall feel the wrath of our vast Tera!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.760
Exceed, Senjinshihou!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:04:59.900
Nay.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.320
That's the Exceed that beat Kuro!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:07.410
No, its power is unimaginably greater compared to that time.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:11.950
Like I thought, he wasn't fighting me seriously.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.120
Nay.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.410
Nay.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:33.770
Reishin!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:35.810
Akane-san!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.190
Kuro-chan.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.210
Are you okay?

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.630
Akane-san?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:04.760
Keita-kun...

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.800
You two are not involved in this fight.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.890
Leave here, quickly.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.020
Does not perish.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:29.820
Art thou

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:30.570
a god?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.570
I am no god.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:35.580
Just like how the two of you are not true gods.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.460
Those who perish at the hands of a god

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.830
are not true gods.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.340
Gods destroy.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.090
We shall destroy.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.840
You false gods...

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.890
I have distorted your hour of awakening!

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:07.360
As of now, you possess a mere fraction of your true power.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.880
Now!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.180
Thousands, Iolite Abyss!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:41.890
Our Tera, hear us, connect us to the depths of our souls!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:49.940
Exceed, Senjinshihou!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.490
It's even more powerful than the one he used just a moment ago.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.950
What an intense Exceed!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.920
I see that by amassing Tera and transferring it all in one go with the Thousands,

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.750
you are magnifying the Mototsumitama's power to its very limits.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:22.350
Come, my strength, and erase the Masagami from existence!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.200
What is...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.420
We do not perish.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.550
Gods

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.880
do not perish.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.340
Undying.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.640
We are eternal.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.220
Due to fate.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.730
They're recreating their bodies.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:10.020
They're still alive in that state?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:19.910
Before you regenerate, I will end it all!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.540
Thousands, Iolite Abyss!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:30.000
With this, it will all be over.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:39.640
I formed a contract with Reishin, believing that if we win this battle, all the curses placed upon us will be removed.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.890
In order to protect Keita-kun and Kuro-chan's life...

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:48.940
To rid us of the Doppeliner system that caused Yuki-san so much suffering...

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:55.240
Although I could not do anything for the others but watch over them before,

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.450
I now have something I can risk my life for.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.450
That something is this battle to remove the curse.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:13.800
No way...

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.960
Kuro-chan?!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.970
We do not perish.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.180
Has she finally awakened?

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.300
Humans,

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.720
perish!

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.980
You're kidding me! Kuro!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.600
We are

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.020
gods.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.860
Don't tell me... It's already...

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:42.620
Perish.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.370
Kuro!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.880
At this rate, it'll be over for us, too.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.100
Does not perish.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.650
Stop this, Kuro!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:12.850
She's so strong!

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.520
That's... Kuro?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:20.150
Could it be that Reishin faked Kuro's death so that he could hide her from the Masagami?

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:39.920
Gods

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.170
do not perish.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.300
They've already finished regenerating?

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.510
No way!

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:12.460
Who would have thought that their power would increase this much with the addition of the third one?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:22.760
Akane-san!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:23.970
Damn it!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.470
Kuro!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:29.470
Are you just going to change into a Masagami like this?

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.640
The time for three to become one

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.480
has come.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.600
We will once again

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.480
become one.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.940
We shall

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.980
reign over this world.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.400
Reign over this world.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.030
Kuro, stop...

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.120
Reishin...

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.080
Kuro...

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.000
What's going to happen to Kuro?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:13:01.090
If Masagami achieves their perfect form, the Mototsumitama known as Kuro may cease to exist.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.630
Cease to exist?

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.760
Kuro! You're not some damned Masagami!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.510
You're Kuro, a Mototsumitama!

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.600
Remember!

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.030
Hexa Wall!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.330
Not yet.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.660
We won't die just yet!

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.540
Someone, hurry up and do something already!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.380
Our hands are pretty tied up here, too!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.760
What can I do for Kuro?

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.050
What should I do?

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:53.560
It has been said that even in the ancient battles, it took centuries upon centuries to seal away Masagami.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:57.730
But at this rate, neither humans nor Mototsumitama will be spared from utter destruction!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.080
Stop it!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:22.500
Kei... ta... san.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.710
Even within us

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.800
there exists something ungodly.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.590
An impure existence.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.590
What's wrong?

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:40.020
Kuro, I'm glad that I met you.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.020
You were perpetually hungry.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.690
And always laughing.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:53.070
But in actuality, you were always feeling lonely, and liked to cry.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:58.540
Even when it looked like you were about to lose, you would always win in the end.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:03.880
My one and only partner in the world: Kuro, the Mototsumitama.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.470
Keita-san?

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.680
Kuro.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.010
You're Kuro, right?

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:18.730
I'll always be Kuro.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.440
Yes. You're right.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:27.360
Kuro, please always remain as you are.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.530
Remain just like when we first met.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.570
Yes.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.450
Let's go, Kuro.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.120
Yes, Keita-san.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.380
A god has become...

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.340
something ungodly...

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:53.340
That's right. We are not gods.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.840
Kuro!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:59.470
Kanashimi ga Yadotta me ni Utsushidasu Kimi no motion

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:59.470
Your motion is reflected within your sad eyes.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.600
Yes!

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:03.730
Omoi ga Nagaretekuru

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:03.730
You immerse yourself within the flow of memories.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.900
Motomerare Sentakushita

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.900
You have sought an option,

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.280
Sono Kotae wa Sou fusion

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.280
and that is "Fusion."

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:13.400
Itami ga Michibiku Saki ni Aru

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:13.400
Pain exists at the start of that path.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:18.740
Kuroi Yami Sematte mo

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:18.740
Even as the darkness draws near,

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.700
Synchro!

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:23.670
Egao wo Itsu mo Kureta

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:23.670
I will always feel your smile.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:28.880
Hikari wo Mamoru Tame

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:28.880
In order to protect the light,

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:35.890
Kimi to Ima Hitotsu ni Nareru...

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:35.890
I will become one with you now...

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:34.260
Keita-san, power is flowing through me.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.220
It is a Tera that rivals that of Masagami.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:41.640
Oitsukenai Hodo no Chikara Te ni Irete

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:41.640
We have to attain a nearly infinite power.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:41.470
The contract between the two of you called Kuro back from her awakening as Masagami?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:46.060
Kaze wo Kiite Tsuranuite Yuke

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:46.060
We'll slice the winds and live through this.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.230
To form a contract with a human

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.940
is ungodly.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:51.480
Dare wo Shinjiteru..? Tsuujiaeta Nara

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:51.480
As long as someone understands this,

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.900
You, who are ungodly,

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:49.730
shall perish.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.530
Perish.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:56.110
Kiseki Okoseru Nando Demo

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:56.110
a miracle will happen, no matter how many times it takes.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.530
Kuro, let's go!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:54.990
Got it, Keita-san!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:01.910
Shinjitsu Itsuka Mieru Kara...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:01.910
Because the truth will eventually be revealed...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.750
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.920
Yosomi Nanka Shiteitara

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.920
If you do something like looking away,

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:13.920
Alright!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.470
Isshun De DESTRUCTION

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.470
destruction will come in a second.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.470
Exceed,

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:20.970
Namida Ja Sukuenai Ne

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:20.970
Tears won't save us, will they?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.350
Gigaexe!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:24.350
Shoubu Wa Kurikaesareru

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:24.350
Battles keep repeating.

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.520
Te Wo Nukazu Agete TENSION

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.520
Without easing up, raise the tension.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:30.690
Akirametara Soko Made Ni Naru

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:30.690
If we give up, that'll be it.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:35.700
Miagereba Semai Ao

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:35.700
Looking up, there is a narrow line of blue.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:40.780
Tatoeba Tobeta No Nara

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:40.780
If we were to fly up,

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:46.000
Jama Suru Mono Wa Nai

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:46.000
nothing could get in our way.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.370
The source

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.450
of impurity.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.960
Disappear!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:52.630
Sora No Sekai Dake Hirogaru...

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:52.630
Everything will extend to the limits of the world in the sky.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.460
They're coming for us!

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.210
Damn you!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:58.590
Onaji Dake No Tsuyosa Mottenakutatte

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:58.590
Even if I don't have the same amount of power,

00:17:58.130 --> 00:17:59.510
Keita, get down!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:03.260
Kakugo Kimete Tsukisusumeba Ii

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:03.260
as long as I make up my mind and charge forward, it will be fine.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.260
This is not good!

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:08.440
Nani Wo Shinjiteru...? Katari Kakeru Koe

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:08.440
What do you believe in...? A voice speaks to me.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:13.270
Naze Kimi Nanoka Wakatta Hi

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:13.270
The day when I understood why it was you,

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:11.770
Keita-san!

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:15.030
Tokeatteita (Kokoro Made Ita...)

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:15.030
we melted togther (to our hearts...)

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.780
Reishin!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.290
Brother!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.550
Reishin? Why did you...

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.900
My Tera is full.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:59.320
Ibuki Keita... What you have done for Kuro... I am grateful.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:02.820
Reishin...

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:11.170
Exceed, Choujinshihou!

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:26.760
Will one who is not a god

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.060
destroy a god?

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.900
You are no god.

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:41.360
You are nothing more than beings born at the same time and from the same Tera as humans and Mototsumitama.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.170
By sacrificing his own Tera,

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:57.800
he took away the regenerative ability conferred upon Masagami by their enormous Tera. Truly, the ultimate Exceed.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:01.970
Then it goes without saying that the one who released it will...

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:04.890
No way...

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.680
Reishin...

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.640
Brother...

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:31.250
kuruhoshi tsuki no shizuku

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:31.250
The drops of the lunatic moon...

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:31.250
kuruhoshi tsuki no shizuku

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:31.250
The drops of the lunatic moon...

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:38.460
hitomegumi mune ni ukete

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:38.460
I receive a blessing with my chest.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:38.460
hitomegumi mune ni ukete

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:38.460
I receive a blessing with my chest.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:43.970
utaou utaou sasayaite

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:43.970
Let us sing, let us sing and whisper.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:43.970
